{"product":{"id":9195681120492,"title":"Norix Evvolve Table with Round or Square Top","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eNorix Evvolve Table\u003c\/strong\u003e pairs a ribbed, rotationally molded polyethylene base with a laminate or DuoForm™ top, for dayrooms, dining areas, activity rooms, and visitation areas in behavioral healthcare and correctional facilities. It comes in 36”, 42”, and 48” round and 36” and 42” square sizes, with a plain laminate top or a game top. The 42” square size is also available with a molded DuoForm™ top.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix designed the ribbed base around rotational symmetry, a pattern linked to a calm, comforting environment. The tapered shape adds stability when the base is ballasted and leaves room to clean around it. The base is made to be weighted on site with 200 lbs of dry sand or gravel, or Norix can ballast it at the factory. Ballast or a bolt-down kit is required to validate the warranty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBase:\u003c\/strong\u003e One-piece rotationally molded high-impact polyethylene with UV stabilizers and a ribbed, tapered design\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLaminate Top:\u003c\/strong\u003e High-pressure laminate over a 45 lb density M3 particle board core, with a 1½” thick radiused molded edge that is pressure fused to the top\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDuoForm™ Top:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fused layers of high-impact polyethylene with UV stabilizers, in Cove or Twilight, fastened to the base with rivnuts for a steel-to-steel connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTop Attachment:\u003c\/strong\u003e Embedded T-nuts give the laminate top a steel-to-steel connection to the base\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTop Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 36”, 42”, or 48” round; 36” or 42” square\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 31.1”\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 55 to 106 lbs, depending on size and top (without ballast)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlain Top Finishes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Titanium Evolve, Wild Cherry, Kensington Maple, Asian Sun, Montana Walnut, Palisades Oak, Calcutta Marble, or Black Alicante laminate with a matching or black molded edge\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGame Top:\u003c\/strong\u003e Optional Titanium Evolve laminate with a printed game board, black molded edge\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBase Colors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Twilight, Cove, Dove, Sienna, or Raven; Citrus, Tranquil, Malibu, Cobalt, Wisteria, LUX Ivory, and LUX Onyx with a 6-piece minimum per color\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Cleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e The base resists blood, vinegar, urine, feces, salt solution, and chlorine solution, and can be cleaned with bleach solutions and hospital-grade disinfectants\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStatic Load Testing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tested to 1,000 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlammability Standards:\u003c\/strong\u003e California Technical Bulletin 133 and ASTM E1537\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironmental Certification:\u003c\/strong\u003e GREENGUARD and GREENGUARD Gold\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10-year limited replacement warranty (5 years for the DuoForm™ top)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Indoor use only\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCountry of Manufacture:\u003c\/strong\u003e USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Models and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEV3600 – 36” Round:\u003c\/strong\u003e Plain top or game top, 74 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEV4200 – 42” Round:\u003c\/strong\u003e Plain top or game top, 88 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEV4800 – 48” Round:\u003c\/strong\u003e Plain top or game top, 106 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEV3636 – 36” Square:\u003c\/strong\u003e Plain top or game top, 85 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEV4242 – 42” Square:\u003c\/strong\u003e Plain top or game top, 104 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEV4242-DF – 42” Square DuoForm™:\u003c\/strong\u003e Molded polyethylene top, 55 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBallasting:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fill the base on site with 200 lbs of dry sand or gravel (not supplied), or order factory ballasting. Ballast or a bolt-down kit is required to validate the warranty.\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBolt-Down:\u003c\/strong\u003e Optional bolt-down kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConcealment Plate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Optional for the DuoForm™ model\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAssembly:\u003c\/strong\u003e Some assembly required; see Norix instructions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Norix Evvolve Table suits dayrooms, dining areas, and activity rooms where a calm look matters as much as durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTypical applications include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eDayrooms and dining halls in correctional and detention facilities\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eBehavioral healthcare facilities and psychiatric hospitals\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eVisitation areas, classrooms, and other common areas\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore Anchortex's \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/bh-behavioral-healthcare-furniture\"\u003eBehavioral Healthcare Anti-Ligature Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/cd-correctional-furniture\"\u003ePrison and Detention Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e collections for more institutional furniture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Dayroom and Dining Tables\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix tables are made for dayrooms, dining halls, classrooms, and visitation areas in correctional and behavioral healthcare facilities, where furniture is used hard every day. The range covers molded-base tables such as the Jupiter, Evvolve, and Molded X-Base; Laminate X-Base tables; and steel-base tables such as the Leg Style, Multi-Purpose, Max-Master, and Oasis.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCommon characteristics of Norix tables include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Tops:\u003c\/strong\u003e High-pressure laminate over a dense particle board core, with molded or T-mold edges depending on the model\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSecure Connections:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tops attach to the base with tamper-resistant hardware for a solid metal-to-metal connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlacement Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Depending on the model, tables can be ballasted, bolted to the floor, or set on tamper-resistant glides\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Cleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smooth surfaces that stand up to routine cleaning in high-traffic areas\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMade in the USA:\u003c\/strong\u003e Built by Norix in the United States\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Furniture\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix manufactures durable furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, police stations, correctional institutions, and residential treatment centers. Explore the full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/norix-furniture\"\u003eNorix Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e at Anchortex.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix","product_type":"","created_at":"2026-03-19T12:39:23-04:00","handle":"norix-evvolve-table","updated_at":"2026-11-24T17:57:07-05:00","published_at":"2026-03-23T17:51:19-04:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-activity-rooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-dining-areas, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-for-waiting-rooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-group-dayrooms, cd-furn-cafeteria, cd-furn-dayroom, cd-furn-visitation, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":47405787447532,"product_id":9195681120492,"title":"EV3600 - 36\" Round \/ Plain Top","price":"1120.00","sku":"N700284-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"1400.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"EV3600 - 36\" Round","option2":"Plain Top","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-03-19T12:39:23-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-24T17:57:07-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":33566,"image_id":null,"weight":74.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":47405819756780,"product_id":9195681120492,"title":"EV3600 - 36\" Round \/ Game Top","price":"1440.00","sku":"N700284-02","position":2,"compare_at_price":"1800.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"EV3600 - 36\" Round","option2":"Game Top","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-03-19T13:09:58-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-24T17:57:07-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":33566,"image_id":null,"weight":74.0,"weight_unit":"lb","require